    "title": "Person in critical condition after being hit by vehicle near Valley Station - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. (WDRB) -- A person is in critical condition at a local hospital after they were hit by a car near Valley Station Wednesday evening. Police were called to Dixie Highway at West Blevins Gap Road around 7 p.m. on a report that a pedestrian had been hit by a vehicle, Louisville Metro Police spokesperson Dwight Mitchell said in a statement. That's just outside Valley Station. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
